OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle large bus
OL,4,Ablaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have tackled a large bus
OL,7,Ffire in Nottingham.
OL,9,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid it was called at 18:20 BST on
OL,11,FTuesday to reports of a large vehicle
OL,12,Ffire in Woodborough Road in Mapperley.
OL,14,FThe service said three crews attended
OL,15,Fthe scene and four firefighters wearing
OL,16,Fbreathing apparatus extinguished the
OL,17,Ffire.
OL,19,FIt added crews left after about an hour
OL,20,Flater and there were no reports of any
OL,21,Finjuries.
